    <string name="section_how">How it works</string>
    <string name="how_camera">The camera path uses ML Kit, fully on device.</string>
    <string name="how_local">Screen reading grabs one frame and decodes it locally; nothing is uploaded and the app has no network permission.</string>
    <string name="how_session">With the session alive the capture permission is asked once, not per scan; the accessibility fallback needs no permission dialog at all.</string>
    <string name="how_payments">Pix and other payment codes are copied to the clipboard because banks only accept the pasted code.</string>
    <string name="how_secure">Secure windows always come back black; use the camera for those.</string>
